WEBVTT

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.800
It's showtime, kid.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.920
Follow my lead
and don't forget your cue.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.240
Hello.
I, uh, just need to cash this.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:22.120
Oh, wowie zowie! What a big bank!

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.600
How many security guards
are in here?

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.920
Who's this little guy?

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.920
Well, that's my grandson,
who still has not learned

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.640
that children should be seen
and not heard.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:35.400
Ha-ha! Kids.
I actually have a son of my own.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.760
Ugh, he looks weird.
Oh! Don't listen to him.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.480
Your son is very, uh... cute.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.800
(YELLS)
Oh, no!

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.440
(GROANS)

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.280
Oh, help! I'm seeing a white light.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.480
Helen, I'm coming for ya.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.440
Helen, I'm coming for ya!
Oh! Help!

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.840
(PAINED GROANING)
Help my... my pop-pop!

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.920
Somebody help him!
Huh?

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.440
My grandpa!
(CHUCKLES WICKEDLY)

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:13.640
This is the big one! Whoa!
(GRUNTS) (YELLS)

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:18.760
You hear that?
It's the sweet sound of angels!

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:21.920
Help!
Oh...

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.480
Do something!
My life is flashing before my eyes!

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.320
(SQUELCH)

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:31.800
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:36.000
(EFFORT GROANS)

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.000
(EFFORT GROANS)

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.280
No, no, no!

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.360
The other way! The other way!
(GROANS)

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.800
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:44.960
Whoa...

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.880
All right, everyone stand back.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.520
(WHIRRING)
Uh-oh.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.040
Clear!
No, wait a minute. Wait...

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.360
(BUZZING)
(GROANS)

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:54.880
Don't give up on me now, buddy!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.040
No, no, no! I'm feeling better!

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.680
Clear!
No, no, no...!

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.040
Maximum charge!

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.680
Clear!
Thank you! You saved my grandpa!

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.840
(GROANS)
Did we... Did we do the heist?

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.240
(LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)
Grandpas say the darndest things!

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.720
You dropped these.
Um...

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:16.480
(PAINED GROANING)

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:22.160
Look what I got!
Hey! Not bad! Not bad at all.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.960
We make a good team.
We do?

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.360
Oh, yeah.
Hey, we gotta keep at it.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.280
Wait till you see
what I'm gonna teach you next.

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:31.440
I cannot wait!

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.720
Oh, this is gonna be fun.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:39.040
(SWOOSHING)
Hmm, hmm, hmm.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:43.280
(SPEAK MINIONESE)

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.760
Ooh, ooh, ooh...

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.240
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.360
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.480
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:00.640
(YELLS) (PANTS)

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.880
Yoo-hoo. Mini-Boss!

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.440
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.560
(ENGINE ROARS)
Time to strike!

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.240
Mini-Boss!
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.880
(CRUNCHING, CLATTERING)

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.440
(DRAMATIC MUSIC)

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:23.120
(SCREAMS) (PANICKED MINIONESE)

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.200
(EVIL LAUGHTER)

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.600
(CRASH)
(SCREAMS)

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:32.280
(SCREAMS)
(SMASH)

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:40.640
Argh! They're not here!
Fan out and find them!

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.520
(ENGINE ROARS)

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.680
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.240
(SIRENS WAIL)

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.480
Something big's going down
in 'Frisco!

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:01.040
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.440
(FIREWORKS BANG)
Oh!

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:07.240
(FIREWORKS FIZZ, POP, SQUEAL)

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.360
Whoo! There it is.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:13.600
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.240
It's been one heck of a ride,
little man.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:16.560
Oh, dude!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:21.040
You know, I'm gonna miss you.
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.600
Hey, soul brother, good luck!
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:29.480
(DISCO MUSIC PLAYS)

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.680
Oh! Ha! Ha!

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.440
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.560
Huh?
(LAUGHING) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:42.240
(GASPS)
Ooh!

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.760
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
(SCREAMS)

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.240
My friend, you're now gonna learn
from the old school.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.120
Wha...
(GASPS)

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.400
(SHRILL, SINISTER MUSIC)

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.280
Oh, no.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.240
(GASPS)

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.240
(CRUNCH)

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.920
I can't believe they did this to me!
(SMASH)

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:20.360
I taught them everything they know!
We were a team!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.920
(SIGHS)
I give up.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:32.160
Hey, you are a great bad guy,
and they are stupid idiots.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:36.720
Only dream I ever had
was doing bad stuff with my buddies.

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:40.240
Now look at me, old, alone.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:44.560
Well, you are old,
but you're not alone.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.400
(GROANS)

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:50.720
All right. Listen up, buster.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.000
We are starting a new team,

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.000
and it's going to be called
"The Terrible Twos."

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.640
We can find a better name later,
but right now,

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.040
we're going to find that stone

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:05.120
and show everybody
that you still got it.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:10.080
Come on. You're just a little kid.
It's over. Go home.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.880
But you said we...
Go home!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.880
(DOOR OPENS, BANGS CLOSED)

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.440
(SLOW, SOMBRE MUSIC)

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.120
(BRAKES SQUEAL)

